WEBVTT

01:18.830 --> 01:21.890
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.010 --> 01:24.730
[Episode 2]

01:25.990 --> 01:26.850
Let's break up.

01:30.560 --> 01:32.220
We don't share the same goals.

01:32.550 --> 01:34.350
We can't understand each other.

01:35.310 --> 01:37.270
We don't even have the most basic trust.

01:37.270 --> 01:39.400
What's the point of staying together?

01:41.270 --> 01:42.479
Mutual trust?

01:44.150 --> 01:46.280
I saw you two together with my own eyes.

01:46.470 --> 01:48.270
How do you expect me to trust you?

01:50.070 --> 01:51.810
How do we not have common goals?

01:52.030 --> 01:54.390
Haven't we always been
working hard for our future?

01:54.390 --> 01:56.310
I never forced you to do anything.

01:56.430 --> 01:58.590
No, you never forced me.

02:00.380 --> 02:02.810
You just made me feel like I was supposed
to go along with everything on my own.

02:02.810 --> 02:05.270
You cook, so I'm expected to
wash the dishes.

02:05.430 --> 02:06.520
You live frugally,

02:06.590 --> 02:08.870
so I'm expected to
cut back and save money too.

02:08.870 --> 02:11.070
You text my parents and check in on them,

02:11.190 --> 02:13.010
so I'm expected to
do the same for your parents

02:13.010 --> 02:14.540
and visit them all the time.

02:16.030 --> 02:16.990
What do you mean?

02:17.350 --> 02:19.470
I cook, do chores,
and care about your parents.

02:19.470 --> 02:20.310
Am I wrong?

02:20.310 --> 02:21.170
No, you're not wrong.

02:21.170 --> 02:22.700
The problem is that you're not wrong.

02:22.700 --> 02:25.270
You're always right.
You're absolutely right.

02:25.270 --> 02:26.740
Anyone who gets to be
with you should feel lucky.

02:26.740 --> 02:27.600
Even to marry you,

02:27.600 --> 02:28.630
you have to provide a house.

02:28.630 --> 02:30.760
You make me feel like I have no dignity.

02:36.210 --> 02:37.070
I get it.

02:37.270 --> 02:38.870
So what you're saying is that

02:39.329 --> 02:41.140
you're breaking up with me

02:41.510 --> 02:42.650
because I've treated you too well?

02:42.650 --> 02:43.850
Is that what you mean?

02:45.400 --> 02:47.460
If that's how you want to put it, sure.

02:50.610 --> 02:52.670
Someone can really make up any excuse

02:52.670 --> 02:54.420
just to break up.

02:55.650 --> 02:57.250
This is just my real feeling.

03:01.860 --> 03:03.790
Did you only have this true feeling

03:05.340 --> 03:06.980
after you met her?

03:07.470 --> 03:10.630
Fine. It's because of her, okay?

03:12.270 --> 03:13.740
You didn't want to live in
my wedding house,

03:13.740 --> 03:16.740
but you're happy being chauffeured
around in her car?

03:17.340 --> 03:19.270
I really have nothing to say to you.

03:32.810 --> 03:37.780
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

03:40.700 --> 03:46.780
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

03:46.370 --> 03:48.650
Love is not everlasting.

03:47.420 --> 03:53.990
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

03:49.410 --> 03:50.840
It is not unchangeable.

03:52.490 --> 03:54.820
Marriage doesn't guarantee love either.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.740
A wife's position

03:55.710 --> 04:00.510
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

03:57.370 --> 03:58.880
is not irreplaceable.

04:02.580 --> 04:06.060
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

04:07.230 --> 04:09.820
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

04:10.540 --> 04:14.490
♪ Truths, lies, and words
said just for show ♪

04:15.450 --> 04:17.040
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

04:17.600 --> 04:21.610
♪ Harsh words, lies, and words
I can't make sense of ♪

04:18.660 --> 04:20.300
Why are you sitting here alone?

04:20.300 --> 04:21.500
Where is Wang Ruohai?

04:22.000 --> 04:22.800
He left.

04:23.040 --> 04:24.630
♪ Pretentious words wrapped in
glitter and glamour ♪

04:23.360 --> 04:24.200
He left?

04:25.110 --> 04:29.430
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

04:26.980 --> 04:28.510
Did he tell you everything?

04:29.920 --> 04:33.540
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

04:30.570 --> 04:31.890
Do you want a cake?

04:32.230 --> 04:34.710
I spent all afternoon
making it. Don't waste it.

04:34.710 --> 04:36.250
Please don't be like this.

04:36.530 --> 04:38.120
Tell me what happened first.

04:38.120 --> 04:40.170
Okay, stop eating.

04:41.610 --> 04:43.820
I saw the woman you mentioned.

04:46.610 --> 04:48.310
We broke up.

04:50.460 --> 04:52.440
Wait, who is that woman anyway?

04:52.460 --> 04:53.460
How did they meet?

04:53.480 --> 04:55.120
How did they end up together?

04:55.970 --> 04:57.130
I don't know.

04:59.240 --> 04:59.770
Let's go.

05:01.970 --> 05:04.670
-Go! Let's go find him.
-I don't want to leave.

05:04.700 --> 05:07.680
-Go! Let's go find him.
-I don't want to leave.

05:07.680 --> 05:09.150
Why is he bullying you like this?

05:09.150 --> 05:09.990
No.

05:13.130 --> 05:15.520
It doesn't matter who she is anymore.

05:16.330 --> 05:19.700
What matters is that
he doesn't want to continue with me.

05:30.910 --> 05:32.090
Alright.

05:34.560 --> 05:36.080
Alright. I'm here.

05:37.100 --> 05:40.180
He said he doesn't want to be with me.

05:57.070 --> 06:02.380
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

06:05.010 --> 06:10.600
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

06:11.510 --> 06:17.600
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

06:19.060 --> 06:24.980
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

06:25.980 --> 06:29.870
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

06:30.510 --> 06:33.700
♪ Are like fireworks lighting up
the night ♪

06:34.280 --> 06:38.230
♪ Truths, lies, and words
said just for show ♪

06:39.250 --> 06:40.790
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

06:41.350 --> 06:45.430
♪ Harsh words, lies, and words
I can't make sense of ♪

06:46.530 --> 06:47.980
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

06:48.640 --> 06:53.030
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

06:50.610 --> 06:52.560
Fei, why are you crying?

06:53.720 --> 06:57.350
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

07:00.560 --> 07:02.410
I, Qian Fei, swear here.

07:03.330 --> 07:04.850
Do you see that?

07:05.580 --> 07:06.510
In the future,

07:06.530 --> 07:08.500
we will definitely have a home of our own.

07:08.500 --> 07:11.030
We will never be kicked out by anyone.

07:13.200 --> 07:20.030
♪ What I dream of is being with you ♪

07:13.320 --> 07:14.580
I, Wang Ruohai, swear

07:14.600 --> 07:16.000
that within three years,

07:16.320 --> 07:18.780
I'll buy you a big and nice house.

07:19.730 --> 07:22.340
Within three years,
I will be very successful.

07:21.080 --> 07:26.810
♪ Hand in hand, taking life
at an easy pace ♪

07:22.370 --> 07:23.960
I will buy a bigger and better house

07:23.960 --> 07:24.660
for you.

07:27.810 --> 07:33.740
♪ What I wish for is something that lasts ♪

07:35.480 --> 07:41.260
♪ Day by day, holding you close
in a life that's simple and true ♪

07:45.840 --> 07:49.290
[Binhu Rd.]

07:51.810 --> 07:52.810
Hey, gorgeous.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.120
Drinking all alone?

07:57.520 --> 07:58.870
Who are you guys?

07:58.890 --> 08:00.490
Come to the bar with us.

08:00.780 --> 08:01.540
My treat.

08:02.100 --> 08:02.840
Yeah.

08:03.470 --> 08:04.940
I, Qian Fei,

08:05.930 --> 08:07.130
don't need anyone.

08:07.940 --> 08:09.420
I can do this by myself.

08:09.860 --> 08:10.810
Don't be shy.

08:10.840 --> 08:13.040
It's so lonely drinking by yourself.

08:13.060 --> 08:13.650
That's right.

08:13.650 --> 08:14.530
Let's go.

08:14.550 --> 08:15.600
Let's go.

08:15.840 --> 08:17.210
Who are you?

08:17.240 --> 08:18.520
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

08:18.540 --> 08:20.580
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

08:20.920 --> 08:22.400
Let go of me!

08:22.450 --> 08:23.720
Hurry up!

08:23.760 --> 08:25.060
Let go of me!

08:25.080 --> 08:27.010
-Don't squat down.
-I'm not going!

08:28.860 --> 08:30.440
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

08:30.470 --> 08:32.010
Come on, step up. Yes.

08:32.030 --> 08:32.280
Go.

08:32.309 --> 08:33.090
That's right.

08:33.090 --> 08:34.309
Go.

08:34.340 --> 08:35.400
-Come with us.
-Let's go.

08:35.400 --> 08:36.120
Let go of me!

08:36.169 --> 08:37.770
-Don't be shy.
-Let's go.

08:38.220 --> 08:39.120
Let go of her hand.

08:39.120 --> 08:39.840
Wait. Who are you?

08:39.840 --> 08:40.520
Hey, you...

08:40.720 --> 08:42.120
I said let go of her.

08:43.070 --> 08:44.330
Are you leaving or not?

08:48.740 --> 08:50.590
Are you okay? Should I...

08:55.310 --> 08:56.750
Why is it you?

08:59.330 --> 09:00.170
Wake up.

09:01.460 --> 09:03.260
What are you doing? Meditating?

09:03.770 --> 09:04.490
Wake up.

09:07.970 --> 09:09.630
Hey, don't sleep here.

09:09.660 --> 09:10.620
Get up.

09:11.330 --> 09:11.980
Get up.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.930
Trying to blackmail me?

09:18.190 --> 09:20.450
Nothing good happens when I run into you.

09:22.330 --> 09:22.950
Come on.

09:22.970 --> 09:24.420
Here, call your family.

09:24.450 --> 09:25.190
Hurry up.

09:29.680 --> 09:31.000
Get up.

10:01.950 --> 10:02.670
Wake up.

10:03.700 --> 10:04.500
Wake up.

10:06.410 --> 10:09.540
Where am I supposed to take you
in the middle of the night?

10:10.930 --> 10:12.700
Damn it, I'm speechless.

10:12.730 --> 10:15.260
Nothing good ever happens
when I run into you.

10:40.830 --> 10:43.140
Just close the windows
and doors when you leave.

10:43.140 --> 10:45.000
The car will lock automatically.

10:51.620 --> 10:52.950
My wallet is still here.

10:56.420 --> 10:57.550
and my phone.

10:59.350 --> 11:01.440
Did I call a car for myself
after drinking too much

11:01.440 --> 11:02.800
and fall asleep in it?

11:02.830 --> 11:05.020
Good thing this driver was kind enough
to help me out.

11:05.020 --> 11:06.580
Otherwise, I'd have been drunk,

11:06.580 --> 11:08.660
homeless for the night,
and heartbroken all at once.

11:08.660 --> 11:10.320
That would've been pathetic.

11:39.560 --> 11:44.310
[Thank you. I'm not sure how much
the fare is, but please take this for now.]

11:44.420 --> 11:46.910
[Information Technology Department]

11:57.710 --> 11:58.430
Fei,

11:59.160 --> 12:00.360
come out for a second.

12:05.540 --> 12:06.670
What's up, Xinyao?

12:07.380 --> 12:09.340
Look, I have a data sheet here.

12:09.380 --> 12:10.490
I need it this afternoon.

12:10.490 --> 12:11.680
I'll ask her later.

12:11.760 --> 12:13.490
Can you double-check it for me?

12:13.960 --> 12:16.240
Director Fang assigned it to me
at the last minute yesterday.

12:16.240 --> 12:19.280
I worked on it all night
and I'm afraid I missed something.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.280
Sure, no problem.

12:20.530 --> 12:22.140
I'll bring it to you when I'm done.

12:22.140 --> 12:23.210
Thank you so much.

12:23.260 --> 12:23.760
It's nothing.

12:23.760 --> 12:25.290
I'll buy you a coffee later.

12:32.340 --> 12:34.450
She's really got some nerve.

12:34.590 --> 12:36.840
I heard she's related to Mr. Kong.

12:37.080 --> 12:39.080
You do not want to get on her bad side.

12:39.430 --> 12:41.090
So what if she's a relative?

12:41.270 --> 12:42.850
You're so naïve.

12:42.880 --> 12:45.060
Alright, let's not talk about this
for now.

12:45.060 --> 12:47.160
You'd better be careful.

12:50.860 --> 12:52.310
[Naranmad Bank]

13:03.950 --> 13:05.680
Are you really going to resign?

13:05.830 --> 13:07.560
You need to think this through.

13:08.210 --> 13:09.670
Getting a job at our bank back then

13:09.670 --> 13:10.800
wasn't easy, was it?

13:11.230 --> 13:11.790
Yes.

13:12.330 --> 13:14.160
Private companies offer high salaries,

13:14.160 --> 13:15.740
but the bank is a better platform.

13:15.740 --> 13:16.340
Wang Ruohai.

13:16.340 --> 13:17.340
Working here...

13:17.830 --> 13:18.670
Come out!

13:18.830 --> 13:19.430
Mr. Chen,

13:19.540 --> 13:20.600
I'll go take a look.

13:21.750 --> 13:23.400
Wang Ruohai!

13:23.640 --> 13:25.120
-Wang Ruohai! Come out!
-Jingjing.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.310
Why are you shouting? Let's talk inside.

13:26.310 --> 13:28.650
Wait, why are you being so sneaky?

13:28.950 --> 13:31.210
I'm not the one having an affair with you.

13:31.350 --> 13:33.270
What affair are you talking about?

13:33.270 --> 13:34.800
Are you still playing dumb?

13:34.820 --> 13:36.890
Who was that woman yesterday?

13:37.110 --> 13:38.620
When did you two get together?

13:38.620 --> 13:40.280
How long have you been lying to Qian Fei?

13:40.280 --> 13:42.480
I've told you many times. She's my client.

13:42.480 --> 13:43.920
My client. My client.

13:44.870 --> 13:47.780
Right, a regular client, huh?

13:48.370 --> 13:49.930
Come look, everyone.

13:49.960 --> 13:52.340
Look at Wang Ruohai's true colors.

13:52.370 --> 13:55.040
He is just a scumbag and a coward,

13:55.060 --> 13:57.080
shameless, hypocritical, and cold-blooded.

13:57.080 --> 13:58.880
He had an improper relationship
with his client,

13:58.880 --> 14:00.740
and doesn't even dare to admit it.

14:00.890 --> 14:02.570
Stop arguing!

14:05.450 --> 14:07.270
Wang Ruohai is no longer a staff member
of our bank.

14:07.270 --> 14:09.530
If you want to make a scene,
do it outside!

14:12.980 --> 14:14.240
What are you looking at?

14:14.240 --> 14:15.500
Is all your work done?

14:33.920 --> 14:34.560
Come here.

14:34.140 --> 14:35.990
[Registration Desk]

14:35.540 --> 14:37.420
What is it, Xinyao?

14:39.050 --> 14:40.510
Give me the delegate pass.

14:41.350 --> 14:42.280
What do you mean?

14:42.710 --> 14:43.940
You're just a back-office employee,

14:43.940 --> 14:46.170
yet you keep stealing work
from the project team.

14:46.170 --> 14:47.590
If you can take my delegate pass,

14:47.590 --> 14:49.080
I dare to come and ask for it back.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.760
Xinyao, this is work.

14:51.490 --> 14:52.490
Stop pretending.

14:52.570 --> 14:54.040
You said you were helping me
organize the files,

14:54.040 --> 14:54.900
but you just took them

14:54.900 --> 14:57.350
to the director to claim credit,
didn't you?

14:57.350 --> 14:59.610
I didn't expect you to be so calculating.

14:59.880 --> 15:01.280
Helping me with the files

15:01.340 --> 15:02.680
not only showed your competence,

15:02.680 --> 15:04.340
but also made you look helpful.

15:04.340 --> 15:06.100
Hi, where is Xinyao's desk?

15:06.130 --> 15:07.190
This one.

15:07.380 --> 15:08.020
Thanks.

15:08.540 --> 15:09.880
This is the data draft she asked for.

15:09.880 --> 15:11.750
Please tell her when she gets back.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.160
Thank you.

15:12.160 --> 15:12.760
No problem.

15:12.760 --> 15:14.300
Did you organize this document?

15:14.260 --> 15:17.520
[Project Team]

15:14.420 --> 15:15.940
No, Xinyao did.

15:15.970 --> 15:17.430
I just helped her check it.

15:20.450 --> 15:21.650
Is there any problem?

15:21.980 --> 15:23.140
No problem at all.

15:25.100 --> 15:26.030
Where is Xinyao?

15:34.930 --> 15:36.190
You're so clumsy.

15:36.220 --> 15:38.330
How did you let a rookie
take your delegate pass?

15:38.330 --> 15:39.850
I let her have it.

15:41.180 --> 15:43.510
You really know how to flatter yourself.

15:44.530 --> 15:46.260
This is a high-level forum.

15:46.280 --> 15:47.670
Security is super strict.

15:47.670 --> 15:48.640
If I wasn't organizing it,

15:48.640 --> 15:50.120
how were you planning to get in?

15:50.120 --> 15:52.070
I'd be doomed without you.

15:53.950 --> 15:54.700
I need to get to work.

15:54.700 --> 15:55.050
Love you.

15:55.050 --> 15:56.440
Find me if you need anything.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.170
Coming.

16:01.100 --> 16:01.900
Stop eating.

16:01.850 --> 16:06.750
[New Frontiers • New Innovation •
New Trends • A Dialogue with the Future]

16:01.920 --> 16:03.450
Mind your image, would you?

16:03.770 --> 16:05.700
It's pretty good. Do you want some?

16:06.260 --> 16:07.340
Hello, Mr. Li.

16:09.640 --> 16:10.990
Didn't I tell you

16:11.010 --> 16:12.690
Don't greet me in public.

16:15.600 --> 16:18.130
Try not to invest in this project.

16:19.260 --> 16:21.720
The old man asked you to remind me,
didn't he?

16:24.220 --> 16:25.330
I'll tell you one more time.

16:25.330 --> 16:27.080
I have nothing to do with Qiansheng now.

16:27.080 --> 16:28.940
Stay out of my business from now on.

16:28.940 --> 16:29.500
Let's go.

16:35.370 --> 16:36.540
Why are you everywhere?

16:36.540 --> 16:39.470
I was about to ask you the same thing.
You're haunting me.

16:39.470 --> 16:40.600
You know each other?

16:41.050 --> 16:43.250
-A lot of people know me.
-Who knows him?

16:46.550 --> 16:48.150
You guys talk. Don't mind me.

16:55.660 --> 16:56.390
Ms. Liao,

16:56.410 --> 16:59.610
everyone who communicated with Zhizhong
and Hejing today

16:59.610 --> 17:01.670
has been ordered to be investigated.

17:04.410 --> 17:06.680
Investigate that woman too.

17:06.880 --> 17:07.609
Understood.

17:08.710 --> 17:11.640
Did you know that was Mr. Guo
from Qiansheng just now?

17:12.020 --> 17:13.000
If you give him a dirty look,

17:13.000 --> 17:14.180
you'd better watch your back.

17:14.180 --> 17:15.730
Mr. Guo from Qiansheng...

17:19.089 --> 17:21.089
You mean that white-haired old man?

17:21.280 --> 17:23.750
Okay, you know a lot of people.

17:25.579 --> 17:27.410
Shouldn't you be clinging to
your Fang Yun?

17:27.410 --> 17:28.390
What are you doing here?

17:28.390 --> 17:30.720
Are you preparing to find another way out?

17:31.000 --> 17:32.760
I'm just trying to be nice and remind you.

17:32.760 --> 17:34.640
You really bite the hand that feeds you.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.640
Give me the money for the phone back.

17:38.310 --> 17:39.110
Let me ask you,

17:39.310 --> 17:40.640
if I give you this money,

17:41.470 --> 17:43.700
does that mean we never have to
see each other again?

17:43.700 --> 17:45.420
I certainly hope so.

17:47.190 --> 17:47.710
Okay.

17:47.760 --> 17:49.060
Come on, let me scan your WeChat.

17:49.060 --> 17:50.720
Who wants to scan your WeChat?

17:51.230 --> 17:52.590
Well, I don't have any cash.

17:52.590 --> 17:53.640
I have cash.

17:57.010 --> 17:58.290
Is 200 enough?

17:58.320 --> 17:59.170
Is 200 enough?

17:59.200 --> 18:01.420
Let's leave it at that. We're even.

18:07.610 --> 18:08.940
Remember to pay me back.

18:18.600 --> 18:20.380
Come on, look at the time.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.600
Stop working so hard.

18:22.090 --> 18:23.470
Let's call Jingjing and go for a drink.

18:23.470 --> 18:24.160
My treat.

18:25.050 --> 18:26.530
No part-time job today?

18:26.550 --> 18:28.210
My part-time job is at the bar.

18:29.410 --> 18:31.970
Let's go. Drinks are discounted.

18:32.080 --> 18:34.130
We can also celebrate you
being single again.

18:34.130 --> 18:35.820
No, not today.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.540
I still have to work overtime.

18:38.040 --> 18:40.500
How about tomorrow? Tomorrow works, right?

18:41.240 --> 18:42.370
Tomorrow is out too.

18:42.470 --> 18:43.890
I have an appointment with an agent.

18:43.890 --> 18:46.120
I'm going to rent out my little apartment.

18:46.120 --> 18:48.450
You're willing to rent out your new place?

18:48.870 --> 18:50.520
You know my salary.

18:50.550 --> 18:53.280
It's too hard for me
to handle the mortgage alone.

18:54.080 --> 18:55.430
You'll need to tidy up the rental.

18:55.430 --> 18:56.230
I'll help you.

18:57.750 --> 18:59.390
No need. Don't worry about me.

18:59.390 --> 19:00.870
When I have everything sorted out,

19:00.870 --> 19:02.210
I'll invite you and Jingjing over,

19:02.210 --> 19:03.740
and we'll have a great meal.

19:05.730 --> 19:06.880
[Hejing Securities Co., Ltd.]

19:06.030 --> 19:07.290
Don't go home too late.

19:08.110 --> 19:08.970
Call me if you need anything.

19:08.970 --> 19:09.520
Okay.

19:09.550 --> 19:10.280
I'm leaving.

19:10.450 --> 19:11.270
Bye.

19:15.940 --> 19:17.340
This way, Miss Gui.

19:17.600 --> 19:18.460
It's over here.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.590
Just a moment.

19:26.730 --> 19:29.040
Look, isn't this space quite large?

19:30.010 --> 19:31.100
It's very cozy too.

19:32.510 --> 19:33.650
Bunk beds.

19:34.900 --> 19:35.960
A children's room?

19:39.280 --> 19:41.390
If you don't use the top bunk,

19:41.410 --> 19:42.840
you can use it for storage.

19:42.840 --> 19:44.720
But this bed is too small.

19:44.750 --> 19:46.520
I wouldn't be able to rest well.

19:47.360 --> 19:49.190
If you really think the bed is small,

19:49.190 --> 19:50.060
you can change to a bigger one.

19:50.060 --> 19:50.830
That's easy to arrange.

19:50.830 --> 19:52.330
But if I change to a bigger bed,

19:52.330 --> 19:54.390
the whole space will become smaller.

19:56.990 --> 19:59.480
How about I show you
the terrace over there?

20:00.890 --> 20:01.610
Let's go.

20:04.990 --> 20:06.680
The terrace where we live now

20:06.700 --> 20:08.300
is much bigger than this one.

20:10.550 --> 20:12.060
I think that's it.

20:49.960 --> 20:51.820
Here you go, handsome. Your milk.

20:52.930 --> 20:53.610
Thank you.

20:58.860 --> 20:59.970
It's delicious.

21:00.770 --> 21:03.130
You can do so many tricks

21:03.160 --> 21:04.660
with a glass of milk. That's amazing.

21:04.660 --> 21:05.410
[A happy, busy day comes to an end.]

21:05.430 --> 21:06.320
[Give myself a thumbs up,
keep it going tomorrow]

21:06.130 --> 21:10.950
Look at this selfie Gui Lili posted.

21:11.640 --> 21:13.200
Who is this guy?

21:13.260 --> 21:14.180
Let me see.

21:15.760 --> 21:17.180
[Gui Lili]

21:15.820 --> 21:17.090
Yeah, who is this guy?

21:17.290 --> 21:18.610
Why can't I see it?

21:18.630 --> 21:19.430
Look at mine.

21:20.400 --> 21:20.780
[A happy, busy day comes to an end.]

21:20.810 --> 21:21.220
[Give myself a thumbs up,
keep it going tomorrow]

21:24.290 --> 21:25.760
[Gui Lili]

21:27.780 --> 21:29.910
Did she put you in a restricted group?

21:34.630 --> 21:36.240
I told her before.

21:36.600 --> 21:38.850
I said I didn't want to
see her work posts.

21:38.850 --> 21:39.890
I didn't want to.

21:40.340 --> 21:41.370
Well...

21:42.080 --> 21:43.570
Based on my experience,

21:44.840 --> 21:46.530
this must be a work relationship.

21:46.530 --> 21:47.650
Makes sense.

21:51.800 --> 21:52.920
Cheers.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.010
Let me tell you,

22:35.010 --> 22:36.410
this house you rented...

22:39.480 --> 22:40.830
Why is it you again?

22:42.960 --> 22:43.970
I'm telling you,

22:43.990 --> 22:45.670
what kind of crappy house is this?

22:45.670 --> 22:46.940
Hurry back and explain this to me,

22:46.940 --> 22:47.770
then pack your things and leave.

22:47.770 --> 22:48.860
How is my house crappy?

22:48.860 --> 22:50.590
Look at the contract yourself.

22:50.690 --> 22:52.460
Deal with it and fix it right now.

22:52.460 --> 22:53.890
Nothing good happens when I see you.

22:53.890 --> 22:54.750
I feel the same.

22:55.330 --> 22:57.000
If your luggage stays here
for another minute,

22:57.000 --> 22:57.970
I feel like I'm running out of oxygen.

22:57.970 --> 22:59.220
My brain is going to explode.

22:59.220 --> 23:00.290
Look closely.

23:00.310 --> 23:02.970
This is your girlfriend's
handwriting, right?

23:04.600 --> 23:06.000
Is she out of her mind?

23:06.030 --> 23:07.370
Why did she rent a shared apartment?

23:07.370 --> 23:08.500
She must be crazy.

23:08.530 --> 23:09.680
Whether she is crazy or not,

23:09.680 --> 23:10.580
go see for yourself.

23:10.580 --> 23:11.530
But as for your luggage,

23:11.530 --> 23:13.420
leaving it here for one more minute
will seriously delay me

23:13.420 --> 23:15.350
from renting this place to someone else.

23:15.350 --> 23:16.170
To break the lease,

23:16.170 --> 23:17.920
you must pay compensation
according to the termination clause.

23:17.920 --> 23:19.070
Fine. Cancel the contract.

23:19.070 --> 23:20.210
Whatever I owe, I'll pay.

23:20.210 --> 23:22.360
I'll call the moving company right now.

23:22.360 --> 23:23.660
You can't cancel it.

23:25.220 --> 23:26.300
I must!

23:26.320 --> 23:28.070
Wait. When you moved in,

23:28.090 --> 23:29.550
you didn't say you had a boyfriend.

23:29.550 --> 23:29.930
And you didn't say

23:29.930 --> 23:31.790
you would move in with your boyfriend.

23:31.790 --> 23:33.030
You didn't ask.

23:33.050 --> 23:34.550
If I told you without you asking,

23:34.550 --> 23:36.550
it would seem like I was showing off.

23:37.320 --> 23:38.900
I am a single girl.

23:38.930 --> 23:40.770
I can't live with a couple.

23:40.800 --> 23:42.340
Let alone live with you.

23:42.370 --> 23:43.270
So,

23:43.380 --> 23:44.200
I hope we can

23:44.220 --> 23:45.940
just pretend nothing ever happened.

23:45.940 --> 23:46.920
Let's part on good terms.

23:46.920 --> 23:48.500
You guys need to pack your things
right now.

23:48.500 --> 23:49.640
I will help you move out.

23:49.640 --> 23:50.620
Hurry up and move.

23:50.620 --> 23:51.540
I'm begging you.

23:51.540 --> 23:52.310
Wait, wait, wait.

23:52.310 --> 23:52.960
You sound like

23:52.960 --> 23:54.170
I really want to live with you.

23:54.170 --> 23:55.040
Don't waste time on her.

23:55.040 --> 23:56.260
Call the moving company. Quick.

23:56.260 --> 23:57.790
Why are we moving?

23:57.970 --> 24:00.360
Lady, look closely at this contract.

24:00.390 --> 24:01.750
There's not a single clause
in the contract

24:01.750 --> 24:03.970
that says I can't live with my boyfriend,

24:03.970 --> 24:04.540
right?

24:04.700 --> 24:06.620
So now you're the one
breaching the contract.

24:06.620 --> 24:07.560
If you want to terminate it,

24:07.560 --> 24:08.900
you need to compensate me.

24:08.900 --> 24:11.240
Me? I'm breaching the contract?

24:11.260 --> 24:13.540
You're pointing the finger at me?

24:13.720 --> 24:14.620
Stop making a scene.

24:14.620 --> 24:16.040
Hurry up, pack your things, and let's go.

24:16.040 --> 24:17.920
Are you helping me or her?

24:18.840 --> 24:20.260
Of course you can choose
not to rent it out.

24:20.260 --> 24:21.260
I'll say it again.

24:21.280 --> 24:22.220
According to the contract,

24:22.220 --> 24:24.660
if you take back the room early
for personal reasons,

24:24.660 --> 24:26.790
you need to refund me
double the rent I've paid

24:26.790 --> 24:27.790
as compensation.

24:27.930 --> 24:28.900
I pay annually.

24:28.920 --> 24:31.220
So, give me two years' rent,

24:31.240 --> 24:32.840
and I'll leave immediately.

24:33.430 --> 24:35.310
Miss, are you robbing me?

24:35.330 --> 24:37.130
If you can't, don't say anything.

24:37.130 --> 24:38.170
I'll rent here.

24:39.160 --> 24:41.110
Can we talk about this when we get back?

24:41.110 --> 24:42.010
I told you to rent an apartment.

24:42.010 --> 24:43.670
I didn't tell you to share one.

24:44.310 --> 24:46.250
I'm saving money for you.

24:46.270 --> 24:47.030
Well,

24:47.590 --> 24:48.700
I can cook,

24:52.230 --> 24:54.520
and I'm actually pretty good at it.

24:58.340 --> 25:00.400
If there's anything special
you want to eat,

25:00.400 --> 25:01.260
you can tell me,

25:01.290 --> 25:02.620
and I can make it for you.

25:04.680 --> 25:06.000
Well,

25:06.110 --> 25:09.610
your apartment is average,

25:09.920 --> 25:10.930
but it's not bad.

25:12.100 --> 25:13.270
It's just that...

25:19.200 --> 25:21.330
Look, property management fees,
utility bills,

25:21.330 --> 25:22.580
and all other miscellaneous fees,

25:22.580 --> 25:23.270
you don't have to worry about them.

25:23.270 --> 25:24.800
Just move in with your bags.

25:26.970 --> 25:29.580
But with this condition,

25:29.610 --> 25:32.000
I still feel this price...

25:35.030 --> 25:36.750
Then another 500 off.

25:36.780 --> 25:38.410
3,500. Low enough?

25:39.910 --> 25:42.110
3,500?

25:42.770 --> 25:44.930
That's 42,000 a year.

25:45.870 --> 25:48.070
With this cost-effectiveness,

25:48.100 --> 25:52.030
you definitely can't rent such
a good apartment outside at this price.

25:55.200 --> 25:56.340
Well,

25:57.030 --> 25:58.990
I think we hit it off.

26:00.370 --> 26:02.830
I'm supporting your career
with practical actions.

26:02.830 --> 26:03.400
Right?

26:03.420 --> 26:04.890
We need to spend money where it counts.

26:04.890 --> 26:05.940
Isn't this shared apartment good?

26:05.940 --> 26:06.720
No.

26:07.500 --> 26:09.360
Go print a termination contract.

26:09.570 --> 26:10.990
What termination contract?

26:10.990 --> 26:12.290
I only acknowledge this contract.

26:12.290 --> 26:13.710
I signed this contract with Qian Fei.

26:13.710 --> 26:14.860
What does it have to do with you?

26:14.860 --> 26:15.580
Qian Fei.

26:15.690 --> 26:16.610
It says here,

26:16.740 --> 26:17.730
if the landlord doesn't rent,

26:17.730 --> 26:19.650
give me two years' rent as a penalty.

26:19.650 --> 26:22.230
I'm not going anywhere today
without the penalty.

26:22.230 --> 26:23.700
Stop being unreasonable here.

26:23.700 --> 26:24.680
Come on.

26:25.040 --> 26:27.120
Refund the rent you owe me.

26:27.380 --> 26:28.230
I'll sign the termination contract.

26:28.230 --> 26:29.600
No, what are you signing?

26:29.600 --> 26:30.220
Let go.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.310
You let go. Don't fight with me.

26:31.310 --> 26:32.290
-Let go!
-Let go!

26:32.330 --> 26:33.570
Let go.

26:33.600 --> 26:34.320
Don't fight with me.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.010
Stop it.

26:35.040 --> 26:35.840
Stop arguing!

26:36.920 --> 26:38.850
I have something I need to tell you.

26:38.850 --> 26:40.740
I don't have money to refund you.

26:41.790 --> 26:42.610
What the hell?

26:44.120 --> 26:45.360
At least for now,

26:45.650 --> 26:47.260
I can't refund all your money.

26:47.260 --> 26:48.070
Why not?

26:50.180 --> 26:52.240
Because I'm still paying off my loan.

26:52.330 --> 26:53.490
So, as for the rent,

26:53.840 --> 26:55.500
I've already spent part of it.

26:55.800 --> 26:57.920
But as soon as I get my salary,

26:57.940 --> 27:00.410
I'll pay you in installments.

27:01.770 --> 27:03.040
For such a small amount of rent,

27:03.040 --> 27:04.820
you still want to pay me in installments?

27:04.820 --> 27:05.420
Because originally,

27:05.420 --> 27:07.080
my boyfriend and I
were paying the mortgage together.

27:07.080 --> 27:08.520
But now we've broken up,

27:08.980 --> 27:11.440
so I'm under a lot of pressure
in this regard.

27:11.790 --> 27:14.410
Okay, I won't argue with you.

27:14.560 --> 27:16.720
Meeting you is the worst luck of my life.

27:16.720 --> 27:17.800
Tell me about it.

27:19.930 --> 27:20.600
With the remaining money,

27:20.600 --> 27:21.940
we can rent a better place, okay?

27:21.940 --> 27:24.190
As for you, refund whatever you have left.

27:24.190 --> 27:25.250
Gui Lili, let's go.

27:25.460 --> 27:26.400
Yifei,

27:27.310 --> 27:29.510
I... I have one more thing to tell you.

27:29.540 --> 27:30.070
Speak.

27:32.070 --> 27:32.800
Well,

27:33.070 --> 27:34.270
let's go out and talk.

27:34.400 --> 27:35.930
Say it right here. Hurry up.

27:38.600 --> 27:40.970
Even if she returns the rent to us,

27:41.280 --> 27:43.410
we probably won't find a better place.

27:43.850 --> 27:44.610
Why?

27:44.730 --> 27:45.970
How much was the rent?

27:50.520 --> 27:51.780
Where did you spend it?

28:08.870 --> 28:09.460
I...

28:11.650 --> 28:12.640
What are you doing?

28:12.640 --> 28:13.700
What are you doing?

28:14.680 --> 28:16.520
Why are you taking it out on money?

28:16.520 --> 28:19.040
If you throw this down and it hits someone,
I'll be responsible.

28:19.040 --> 28:19.700
Let me tell you.

28:19.700 --> 28:21.290
Return this bag immediately.

28:21.290 --> 28:22.160
I won't return it.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.030
If you don't return it, sell it.

28:23.030 --> 28:23.880
I won't sell it!

28:23.880 --> 28:25.410
If you don't sell it,
we'll sleep on the streets.

28:25.410 --> 28:27.020
I won't sleep on the streets!

28:27.040 --> 28:28.370
I paid the rent for this place.

28:28.370 --> 28:29.530
Why should I sleep on the streets?

28:29.530 --> 28:31.310
Besides, I have so many things.

28:31.330 --> 28:32.480
I can't even move them.

28:32.480 --> 28:33.490
Too many things, huh?

28:33.490 --> 28:35.610
Fine, I'll throw them all away for you.

28:35.610 --> 28:36.010
You!

28:36.040 --> 28:38.610
-It's just these boxes.
-Why did you touch my stuff?

28:38.610 --> 28:39.000
Throw them all away.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.080
You are not allowed to move.

28:40.080 --> 28:41.670
Don't move them.

28:41.790 --> 28:44.390
Stop messing around
and fulfill the contract.

28:46.880 --> 28:48.140
Fulfill the contract.

28:58.150 --> 28:58.970
Since

28:59.560 --> 29:00.820
I can't refund the rent

29:01.310 --> 29:03.910
and you don't have money
to live anywhere else,

29:04.290 --> 29:05.620
if worst comes to worst,

29:05.820 --> 29:08.080
the three of us will just
live together for now.

29:08.080 --> 29:09.630
When you have the money

29:09.900 --> 29:11.180
to move somewhere else,

29:11.180 --> 29:13.290
or when I have the money

29:13.310 --> 29:14.170
to pay you back,

29:14.310 --> 29:16.370
you will move out immediately. Okay?

29:16.830 --> 29:17.290
Okay.

29:17.320 --> 29:18.400
No.

29:18.770 --> 29:19.460
If not,

29:19.480 --> 29:21.360
can you think of a better idea?

29:23.970 --> 29:25.080
How about this?

29:25.460 --> 29:27.590
We can sign a supplementary agreement

29:27.770 --> 29:29.420
regarding the co-tenancy period

29:29.420 --> 29:31.550
and the daily rules for the three of us.

29:34.400 --> 29:36.860
Qian Fei, you're really something.

29:38.260 --> 29:39.570
I knew it.

29:39.600 --> 29:40.810
Anyone working for Fang Yun

29:40.810 --> 29:42.290
is extremely shrewd.

29:45.920 --> 29:46.620
Wait.

29:47.540 --> 29:48.740
Wait, wait, wait.

29:49.560 --> 29:50.880
How come I...

29:52.190 --> 29:52.830
Listen.

29:53.190 --> 29:54.910
What's going on between you two?

29:54.910 --> 29:56.820
So you two have known each other
all along?

29:56.820 --> 29:58.180
No, you're overthinking it.

29:58.180 --> 29:59.250
There is nothing between us.

29:59.250 --> 30:00.690
We've only met twice.

30:01.660 --> 30:02.520
You obviously know her.

30:02.520 --> 30:03.780
Why pretend you don't?

30:03.880 --> 30:05.040
Did I pretend?

30:06.380 --> 30:08.110
Excuse me, do I need to pretend?

30:09.150 --> 30:10.230
And let me tell you,

30:10.530 --> 30:11.930
living with her,

30:11.960 --> 30:13.690
you'll have plenty of bad luck.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.900
Just wait and see if you don't believe me.

30:20.500 --> 30:22.040
What a jerk.

30:44.340 --> 30:45.840
Wait, wait!

30:51.030 --> 30:53.400
Driving this car is really something else.

30:53.400 --> 30:55.040
Getting hit on so fast.

31:04.500 --> 31:05.420
Can I help you?

31:05.450 --> 31:07.520
It's me. You don't remember me?

31:09.890 --> 31:11.090
Do we know each other?

31:11.940 --> 31:13.000
It was this car.

31:13.020 --> 31:14.280
I remember it clearly.

31:16.070 --> 31:17.770
You see, the license plate matches too.

31:17.770 --> 31:19.360
I had too much to drink that day.

31:19.360 --> 31:20.280
I took your car.

31:20.310 --> 31:21.770
You drove me to my company.

31:21.770 --> 31:24.230
And you let me sleep
in your car for the night.

31:24.650 --> 31:25.730
You don't remember?

31:25.730 --> 31:27.590
You said you had too much to drink,

31:28.030 --> 31:29.640
and got in this car?

31:30.510 --> 31:32.320
I must have caused you a lot of trouble.

31:32.320 --> 31:33.610
I'm really sorry about that.

31:33.610 --> 31:35.450
I remember now. It's you.

31:35.770 --> 31:36.930
It's nothing.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.360
I'm always happy to help.

31:38.380 --> 31:40.510
What a coincidence that we meet again.

31:40.850 --> 31:42.270
Let's properly introduce ourselves.

31:42.270 --> 31:43.300
I'm Zihao.

31:43.960 --> 31:45.070
I'm Qian Fei.

31:45.300 --> 31:46.500
Nice to meet you.

31:46.520 --> 31:47.520
Nice to meet you too.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.820
I hope if fate allows,

31:48.840 --> 31:50.370
I can ride in your car again.

31:51.260 --> 31:51.980
Okay.

31:52.280 --> 31:53.080
Thank you.

32:06.600 --> 32:08.100
Why are you just coming back?

32:08.100 --> 32:09.830
You made me wait here all alone.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.520
Where is the silly landlady?

32:14.030 --> 32:14.960
She went out.

32:16.020 --> 32:18.080
What exactly were you doing just now?

32:18.720 --> 32:19.660
Zihao came to get the car.

32:19.660 --> 32:20.720
I gave him the keys.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.190
What car?

32:23.510 --> 32:25.240
Didn't he lend me money?

32:26.600 --> 32:28.200
I used the car as collateral.

32:28.690 --> 32:30.790
So you mean you not only
have no house now,

32:30.790 --> 32:32.010
but also no car?

32:33.610 --> 32:36.540
Didn't you always say
I only look good on
the outside?

32:36.720 --> 32:38.450
Now I'm the same inside and out.

33:04.850 --> 33:06.540
These are the things you left at my place.

33:06.540 --> 33:08.070
I brought them over for you.

33:09.840 --> 33:11.900
As for the mortgage money you lent me,

33:12.410 --> 33:14.140
I will find a way to pay you back.

33:14.660 --> 33:16.990
But I don't have that much money
right now.

33:18.550 --> 33:20.000
I drafted an agreement

33:20.030 --> 33:21.090
with

33:21.860 --> 33:23.190
my repayment plan on it.

33:23.280 --> 33:24.770
If you think it's okay,

33:24.800 --> 33:25.790
you can

33:26.040 --> 33:27.570
sign it and send a copy to me.

33:30.510 --> 33:33.710
And we need to deal with
the booked wedding banquet early,

33:33.960 --> 33:35.860
so we can get some compensation.

33:37.150 --> 33:37.790
Okay.

33:39.030 --> 33:40.360
I know you hate trouble,

33:40.360 --> 33:41.800
so I will go handle it.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.010
As for the refunded money,

33:44.010 --> 33:46.620
I will give you your share.

33:47.480 --> 33:48.620
As for mine,

33:48.840 --> 33:50.440
I won't shortchange myself.

33:53.180 --> 33:54.910
I thought you would be very sad.

33:55.350 --> 33:57.550
Seeing you are still the same as before,

33:58.990 --> 34:00.060
I'm relieved.

34:03.490 --> 34:06.970
Wang Ruohai, you said

34:08.110 --> 34:10.920
that you didn't want to use the house
I bought for our marriage,

34:10.920 --> 34:12.719
saying it would be a loss of face.

34:13.980 --> 34:15.159
But you know what?

34:15.989 --> 34:18.969
My dad didn't hesitate

34:19.000 --> 34:22.510
to take out all his savings
to pay the down payment for that house.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.679
To him,

34:24.270 --> 34:25.880
that money wasn't just for me.

34:25.880 --> 34:27.040
It was for us.

34:27.860 --> 34:28.679
It was to give us

34:28.679 --> 34:30.480
a shelter from the wind and rain.

34:30.860 --> 34:32.989
It was also his care and support for us.

34:36.040 --> 34:37.929
The reason you felt disrespected

34:38.370 --> 34:40.699
wasn't because you were greatly wronged,

34:40.840 --> 34:43.170
but because of your inferiority complex.

34:44.139 --> 34:46.860
So even if you buy a better house,

34:47.130 --> 34:48.750
you will still compare yourself
with others.

34:48.750 --> 34:50.580
You will feel your house isn't big enough

34:50.580 --> 34:51.780
or luxurious enough.

34:53.330 --> 34:54.130
Are you done?

34:54.150 --> 34:54.710
No.

34:57.930 --> 35:01.100
At first, I even reflected on myself,
wondering what I did wrong.

35:01.100 --> 35:02.300
But then the next day

35:02.850 --> 35:03.770
you said

35:04.650 --> 35:06.130
I was giving you too much,

35:06.340 --> 35:08.270
that I was putting pressure on you.

35:08.380 --> 35:09.640
That's when I realized

35:10.810 --> 35:12.810
it was all just an excuse. Wasn't it?

35:14.330 --> 35:17.090
Then please be honest when breaking up.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.960
Don't think about betraying me

35:18.960 --> 35:20.260
while pushing all the blame
for the breakup

35:20.260 --> 35:21.520
onto the other person.

35:23.450 --> 35:25.690
Don't you think you are
being too hypocritical?

35:25.690 --> 35:27.860
Self-abased, hypocritical.

35:29.820 --> 35:31.820
Is this your final evaluation of me?

35:31.990 --> 35:32.630
Yes.

35:33.180 --> 35:36.180
So I am very happy
that my future doesn't have you in it.

35:42.900 --> 35:43.630
I'm leaving.

36:04.970 --> 36:06.040
Here's the thing, Jingjing.

36:06.040 --> 36:07.640
I think there's something

36:07.660 --> 36:08.980
I need to tell you.

36:09.680 --> 36:10.560
Go ahead.

36:11.620 --> 36:12.950
It's about Wang Ruohai.

36:14.620 --> 36:15.280
So...

36:15.640 --> 36:16.990
You know that night we were out jogging?

36:16.990 --> 36:19.220
We ran into Wang Ruohai with that woman.

36:20.340 --> 36:21.470
I actually know her.

36:22.980 --> 36:24.140
You know her?

36:25.120 --> 36:25.840
Who is she?

36:26.630 --> 36:28.490
No, no, listen to me. Listen to me.

36:29.350 --> 36:30.610
Her name is Liao Shiyu,

36:30.620 --> 36:33.150
the Vice President of
Shanlifang Hotel Group.

36:33.150 --> 36:35.480
Her father is Liao Jinshan, the chairman.

36:35.720 --> 36:36.880
Vice president?

36:39.030 --> 36:41.450
She's so rich, yet she's a mistress?

36:41.480 --> 36:42.870
That's so shameless.

36:43.210 --> 36:44.830
Of all the things in the world
she could be,

36:44.830 --> 36:47.000
she chose to be a bitch. Unbelievable.

36:47.550 --> 36:48.680
Shanlifang, right?

36:50.120 --> 36:50.740
Okay.

36:51.650 --> 36:52.550
Let me go see her.

36:52.550 --> 36:53.830
Wait, what are you doing?

36:53.830 --> 36:55.290
I'm going to settle this with her!
-Wait, calm down.

36:55.290 --> 36:56.510
Wait, calm down.

36:56.540 --> 36:58.220
-Why are you so annoying?
-Jingjing!

36:58.220 --> 36:59.200
-What kind of woman is she?
-Calm down!

36:59.200 --> 37:00.950
-Calm down, baby.
-What are you doing? Let me go.

37:00.950 --> 37:01.430
Baby.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.360
Calm down, calm down!

37:03.400 --> 37:04.830
Calm down.

37:04.860 --> 37:06.320
Listen to me. Listen to me.

37:06.450 --> 37:07.920
They've already broken up.

37:07.920 --> 37:09.580
It's no use going to Liao Shiyu now.

37:09.580 --> 37:10.580
Why?

37:10.620 --> 37:11.940
Am I going to let that mistress

37:11.940 --> 37:13.220
have it so easy

37:13.240 --> 37:14.440
and bully our Qian Fei like this?

37:14.440 --> 37:15.250
No, no, no.

37:15.280 --> 37:16.140
What kind of people are they?

37:16.140 --> 37:16.860
Jingjing,

37:16.890 --> 37:18.290
it's their problem.

37:18.310 --> 37:19.910
Just let them solve it themselves.

37:19.910 --> 37:21.060
How can she solve it?

37:21.080 --> 37:22.110
She's so clueless.

37:22.110 --> 37:23.270
How is she supposed to solve it?

37:23.270 --> 37:24.230
No, no, right now

37:24.260 --> 37:26.510
you can't take her place anyway.

37:32.160 --> 37:35.040
Shanlifang acquired your Xinxin Vision.

37:36.580 --> 37:37.950
That Liao what's-her-name...

37:37.950 --> 37:39.360
Liao... Liao Shiyu.

37:39.880 --> 37:43.300
So Liao Shiyu is practically
your boss now, right?

37:43.560 --> 37:46.020
You're afraid of offending her,
aren't you?

37:46.780 --> 37:48.020
Lu Ze, how come

37:48.040 --> 37:50.270
you're such a coward now?

37:50.710 --> 37:52.080
You... You can call me a coward.

37:52.080 --> 37:53.280
I admit it, Jingjing.

37:53.940 --> 37:56.010
After all, Xinxin Vision
has dozens of employees.

37:56.010 --> 37:57.430
It... It doesn't just belong to me.

37:57.430 --> 37:58.820
Dozens of guys are relying on me
to feed their families.

37:58.820 --> 37:59.510
Right?

37:59.540 --> 38:01.600
I have no choice but to think this way.

38:01.820 --> 38:04.480
Qian Fei and Wang Ruohai
have already broken up.

38:04.480 --> 38:06.430
Looking for Liao Shiyu won't help.

38:06.560 --> 38:08.760
You'll only add to Qian Fei's troubles.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.800
All right, all right, all right.

38:11.800 --> 38:13.600
Calm down. Calm down, baby.

38:16.130 --> 38:18.370
Since they've already broken up,

38:18.830 --> 38:20.990
you should advise Qian Fei to move on.

38:21.390 --> 38:22.830
Spend more time with her.

38:34.790 --> 38:37.130
Fei, tell me everything.

38:37.350 --> 38:40.270
About Qian Fei, I heard that one night...

38:42.620 --> 38:43.480
What did he say?

38:43.940 --> 38:44.540
Nothing.

38:47.330 --> 38:48.900
I told you it's nothing.

38:50.140 --> 38:52.100
What exactly is your relationship?

38:52.100 --> 38:54.440
We just ran into each other at work.

38:54.580 --> 38:56.310
We hardly even know each other.

38:57.340 --> 38:59.340
Li Yifei, have a little conscience.

38:59.340 --> 39:01.660
I think of you in everything I do

39:01.690 --> 39:03.290
and even packed your things.

39:03.460 --> 39:04.820
You can't betray me.

39:07.230 --> 39:08.850
You rented this crappy place, didn't you?

39:08.850 --> 39:10.310
Did you discuss it with me?

39:11.320 --> 39:12.920
And now I'm the one without a conscience?

39:12.920 --> 39:13.440
You...

39:14.540 --> 39:17.340
You sold your house and car
without discussing with me.

39:17.340 --> 39:19.270
I only found out at the last minute.

39:19.390 --> 39:20.480
Who said that we shouldn't interfere

39:20.480 --> 39:22.070
with each other's work?

39:23.440 --> 39:24.950
It's like when you have dinner
with clients.

39:24.950 --> 39:26.410
You didn't tell me either.

39:26.980 --> 39:27.740
Li Yifei,

39:28.440 --> 39:30.600
don't you even have basic trust in me?

39:31.740 --> 39:33.970
I just want you to respect yourself.

39:34.680 --> 39:36.560
Don't treat yourself like an escort.

39:36.560 --> 39:38.000
You're going too far!

39:39.470 --> 39:41.400
I don't want to talk to you anymore.

39:43.480 --> 39:45.610
Wait, I haven't finished packing yet.

39:52.670 --> 39:53.760
Please come in, sir.

39:53.760 --> 39:54.360
Thank you.

39:57.630 --> 39:59.540
Hello, Chairman Liao.

40:00.190 --> 40:01.670
Have a seat.

40:10.290 --> 40:12.410
We know each other,
no need to be so polite.

40:12.410 --> 40:14.670
Call me Uncle Liao in private from now on.

40:14.960 --> 40:16.010
I can't do that.

40:16.290 --> 40:18.020
I still have to call you Chairman Liao.

40:18.020 --> 40:19.340
You're here because of

40:19.370 --> 40:20.510
Shanlifang's IPO, aren't you?

40:20.510 --> 40:21.510
Since this is business,

40:21.510 --> 40:24.360
I should stick to formal titles
like everyone else.

40:24.360 --> 40:25.480
Here.

40:25.730 --> 40:27.110
Have some of the new tea.

40:27.440 --> 40:28.900
Thank you, Chairman Liao.

40:33.150 --> 40:33.680
Good tea.

40:35.560 --> 40:37.620
Mr. Huang from your Zhizhong Capital

40:38.440 --> 40:40.370
getting into that kind of trouble,

40:40.400 --> 40:41.680
really worries me.

40:42.220 --> 40:44.910
There are too many tricks
in investment banking.

40:44.910 --> 40:46.080
I can't figure them out.

40:46.080 --> 40:48.490
That's why I need someone

40:48.720 --> 40:50.510
completely trustworthy

40:50.540 --> 40:52.030
to help me control the overall situation.

40:52.030 --> 40:53.350
I understand.

40:55.600 --> 40:58.240
Ensuring the company
meets listing standards

40:59.060 --> 41:01.460
is the very purpose
of our role as a sponsor.

41:02.930 --> 41:03.860
Okay.

41:04.930 --> 41:06.010
I'm begging you.

41:06.030 --> 41:07.750
Please refund my deposit.

41:07.930 --> 41:10.010
If you really can't give a full refund,

41:10.010 --> 41:11.960
80% is fine too.

41:12.970 --> 41:13.890
Miss Qian,

41:13.940 --> 41:17.220
you already booked
a discounted wedding banquet.

41:17.450 --> 41:18.750
It's written in the contract.

41:18.750 --> 41:20.440
I really can't help you.

41:20.470 --> 41:22.460
Yes, you can.

41:22.690 --> 41:24.050
Even half is fine.

41:25.450 --> 41:26.520
You look so pale.

41:26.550 --> 41:27.680
Are you sick?

41:28.030 --> 41:28.910
I'm fine.

41:32.940 --> 41:34.020
Let me tell you,

41:34.050 --> 41:36.930
this isn't the first time
we've encountered this.

41:36.950 --> 41:38.620
No matter what you say, it's useless.

41:38.620 --> 41:40.090
Okay, that's it.

41:51.180 --> 41:53.400
What are you doing?
Faking an illness for money?

41:53.400 --> 41:55.280
It doesn't work. Look, he's left.

41:55.420 --> 41:57.320
Try another method next time.

41:57.880 --> 41:59.320
I'm fine. Leave me alone.

42:01.590 --> 42:03.050
You're quite persistent.

42:03.710 --> 42:04.840
Okay, carry on then.

42:08.880 --> 42:11.680
Why do I always run into
this landlady's problems?

42:14.250 --> 42:14.980
Come with me.

42:17.820 --> 42:18.520
I'm not leaving.

42:18.520 --> 42:20.140
I'm not going anywhere without a refund.

42:20.140 --> 42:21.010
At a time like this?

42:21.010 --> 42:22.530
Is money more important than your life?

42:22.530 --> 42:25.010
It's common sense that deposits are
non-refundable. Understand?

42:25.010 --> 42:25.650
Let's go.

42:27.030 --> 42:27.890
Where to?

42:27.990 --> 42:28.920
To the hospital.

42:29.450 --> 42:31.340
Just take me home. I'm not sick.

42:39.440 --> 42:40.550
We're here?

42:40.710 --> 42:42.280
No, we're at a pharmacy.

42:46.890 --> 42:49.220
[We're Hiring: Top Salary Offered]

42:52.360 --> 42:53.760
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:56.830 --> 42:59.830
Sir, let's wait until she's done
taking the medicine.

43:00.390 --> 43:02.150
We're finally here.

43:06.470 --> 43:07.840
What is this?

43:08.840 --> 43:10.100
Qian Fei,

43:10.130 --> 43:11.640
why aren't you going in?
What are you doing here?

43:11.640 --> 43:12.930
I want you to do me a favor.

43:12.930 --> 43:13.890
What is it?

43:13.910 --> 43:15.300
Please tell Li Yifei

43:15.320 --> 43:16.780
I want to break up with him.

43:17.160 --> 43:17.850
Break up?

43:18.020 --> 43:19.570
So can you explain

43:19.600 --> 43:21.360
what happened in this photo?

43:22.230 --> 43:23.100
Well,
